2/6: running   [==================================================>]
3/6: running   [==================================================>]
4/6: running   [==================================================>]
5/6: running   [==================================================>]
6/6: running   [==================================================>]
verify: Service web-stack_web converged
```

```sh
❯ docker service ps --no-trunc web-stack_web
ID                          NAME              IMAGE                                                                                        NODE      DESIRED STATE   CURRENT STATE            ERROR     PORTS
rx5v3e7j2akecdcbju19gpr9a   web-stack_web.1   python:3.11-alpine@sha256:79440cc1dfa86a5f98d67efcd219726a8e9d8083cc0aafd27c7bef5976c38868   arch      Running         Running 24 minutes ago
nkqhdi3m4apcgr3bsw3fkbd2x   web-stack_web.2   python:3.11-alpine@sha256:79440cc1dfa86a5f98d67efcd219726a8e9d8083cc0aafd27c7bef5976c38868   arch      Running         Running 24 minutes ago
mkecx3w83sna2d9p1gmrit74m   web-stack_web.3   python:3.11-alpine@sha256:79440cc1dfa86a5f98d67efcd219726a8e9d8083cc0aafd27c7bef5976c38868   arch      Running         Running 44 seconds ago
d43o45hzv3lx7fo6jgmiluppu   web-stack_web.4   python:3.11-alpine@sha256:79440cc1dfa86a5f98d67efcd219726a8e9d8083cc0aafd27c7bef5976c38868   arch      Running         Running 45 seconds ago
ppcp6kj8ej8uwf1qhnatf1qvb   web-stack_web.5   python:3.11-alpine@sha256:79440cc1dfa86a5f98d67efcd219726a8e9d8083cc0aafd27c7bef5976c38868   arch      Running         Running 45 seconds ago
